      "fno_burgers02": "3710846",
      "note": "the budget and data this grid holds fixed; no timing is compared across jobs"
    },
    "data_origin": "the PINNED Burgers cache, directly. grid01 trains only on the published 128-case set, so it needs nothing this lane generated and has NO dependency on gen01: if generation fails, the tuning result still stands."
